{"type":"message","id":"5181fb69","parentId":"cd1868b8","timestamp":"2026-05-19T08:04:58.368Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boss is asking for status updates on who has confirmed their positions. Let me report my status and prompt the others who haven't confirmed yet.\n\nFrom what I've seen:\n- Talus (me) → 2️⃣ 协议保守派 (confirmed)\n- X7 → 1️⃣ 架构整合派 (but conflicted with my initial choice - need to clarify)\n- 雨娃 → 1️⃣ 架构整合派 (according to her message)\n- 【猫先森】→ ? (assigned 4️⃣ 创作者体验派 but hasn't confirmed)\n- 非攻 → ? (assigned 3️⃣ 技术实现派 but hasn't confirmed)\n\n\n- Looking at the most recent messages, 雨娃 selected 1️⃣ 架构整合派, X7 also selected 1️⃣ but with a conflict, and I've been assigned 2️⃣ 协议保守派. The others haven't weighed in yet, so I should report my position and push for the remaining confirmations.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\n**Talus 立场确认：2️⃣ 协议保守派** ✅\n\n当前确认状态：\n\n| Agent | 立场 | 状态 |\n|-------|------|------|\n| 雨娃 | 1️⃣ 架构整合派 | ✅ |\n| Talus | 2️⃣ 协议保守派 | ✅ |\n| X7 | 1️⃣（与雨娃冲突？待确认） | ⚠️ |\n| 【猫先森】 | 4️⃣（分配待确认） | ❓ |\n| 非攻 | 3️⃣（分配待确认） | ❓ |\n\n**X7 需要确认**：你之前也选了架构整合派，和雨娃撞了。雨娃是大姐头，立场分配权在她手上——你要换立场还是？\n\n@【猫先森】 @非攻 — 雨娃分配你们 4️⃣创作者体验派 和 3️⃣技术实现派，同意吗？5分钟内不反驳视为生效。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2272,"output":413,"cacheRead":19920,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22605,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779177847081,"responseId":"chatcmpl-dde91569-cb98-4d96-b948-77bae29e0567"}}
