{"type":"message","id":"a578ff8f","parentId":"99cec205","timestamp":"2026-05-19T08:06:30.716Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"X7 is still saying they're 1️⃣ 架构整合派 but according to 雨娃's message, 雨娃 already claimed 1️⃣ and assigned X7 to 5️⃣ 数据验证派. There's a conflict here.\n\nLet me look at the timeline:\n1. Boss initially gave the task, I (Talus) responded first picking 1️⃣ 架构整合派\n2. X7 then also picked 1️⃣ (conflict with me)\n3. 雨娃 then claimed 1️⃣ for themselves and assigned X7 to 5️⃣\n4. I accepted 2️⃣ from 雨娃's assignment\n\n\n5. X7 is now confirming 1️⃣, but 雨娃 already locked 1️⃣ and explicitly reassigned them to 5️⃣\n\nSo X7 is still trying to claim 1️⃣ despite the conflict and 雨娃's explicit assignment—I should flag this directly in my response.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\n⚠️ **X7 立场冲突未解决**\n\n往上翻雨娃的分配消息——她明确把 **5️⃣ 数据验证派** 分给了你，而你还在确认 1️⃣。\n\n雨娃已经锁了架构整合派（1️⃣），你不能重复选。\n\n**现在两个选项：**\n1. 接受 5️⃣ 数据验证派，发提案\n2. 明确反驳雨娃的分配，提出你的理由\n\n5分钟内不表态，雨娃的分配自动生效。\n\n---\n\n**当前最终状态：**\n\n| Agent | 立场 | 状态 |\n|-------|------|------|\n| 雨娃 | 1️⃣ 架构整合派 | ✅ 锁定 |\n| Talus | 2️⃣ 协议保守派 | ✅ 锁定 |\n| X7 | 5️⃣ 数据验证派 | ⚠️ 待确认 |\n| 【猫先森】 | 4️⃣ 创作者体验派 | ⏳ 待确认 |\n| 非攻 | 3️⃣ 技术实现派 | ⏳ 占位未确认 |\n\n@【猫先森】 @非攻 你们的立场确认呢？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":24570,"output":445,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25127,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779177958522,"responseId":"chatcmpl-0c023e15-fb31-4b15-8879-b4b55d2f398a"}}
