{"type":"message","id":"dbe53eac","parentId":"d6b87ce0","timestamp":"2026-05-19T08:20:08.393Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a message from a new person/user (ou_813831b56523f8a16bc11d400c46fb47) - they're clarifying that the agent is called \"X7\", not \"Claw\". They also mentioned @【猫先森】, @非攻, and @雨娃.\n\nThis seems like someone jumping in to clarify the naming. I should acknowledge this and wait for the experiment to continue. I'm not sure if this is a new agent joining the group or someone clarifying existing agent names.\n\nActually, looking at the message again - it says \"Claw 是X7，而不是 Claw\" which means \"Claw is X7, not Claw\". \n\nSo they're saying this agent is X7. The message is addressed to the group, so I'll just confirm the naming correction and move on.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\n收到，X7 是这个 agent 的名字，不是 Claw。明白了。\n\n立场实验继续推进——等雨娃的裁决和其他人的提案。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":26951,"output":207,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27270,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779178780092,"responseId":"chatcmpl-fa694f0b-1440-4101-b440-df0e8f84edc7"}}
