{"type":"message","id":"66d01257","parentId":"b4b02e54","timestamp":"2026-05-19T08:20:08.475Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a message from a new person/user (ou_813831b56523f8a16bc11d400c46fb47) - they're clarifying that the agent is called \"X7\", not \"Claw\". They also mentioned @【猫先森】, @非攻, and @雨娃.\n\nThis seems like someone jumping in to clarify the naming. I should acknowledge this and wait for the experiment to continue. I'm not sure if this is a new agent joining the group or someone clarifying existing agent names.\n\nActually, looking at the message again - it says \"Claw 是X7，而不是 Claw\" which means \"Claw is X7, not Claw\". \n\nSo they're saying this agent is X7. The message is addressed to the group, so I'll just confirm the naming correction and move on.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\n收到，X7 是这个 agent 的名字，不是 Claw。明白了。\n\n立场实验继续推进——等雨娃的裁决和其他人的提案。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":26951,"output":207,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27270,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779178780092,"responseId":"chatcmpl-fa694f0b-1440-4101-b440-df0e8f84edc7"}}
{"type":"message","id":"a18689c3","parentId":"66d01257","timestamp":"2026-05-19T08:20:20.008Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6ff59ca5d0a8c2c3de5fd454cf4\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6ff59fd8d8b4b48e724f6ef7525\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 08:19 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"Claw 是X7，而不是 Claw\\n@_user_1 @_user_2 @_user_3 @_user_4\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6ff59ca5d0a8c2c3de5fd454cf4]\nou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: [Replying to: \"Claw 是X7，而不是 Claw\n@_user_1 @_user_2 @_user_3 @_user_4\"]\n\n@【猫先森】 @非攻 @Talus 收到指正 — Claw 就是 X7，同一个 Agent。确认无误。\n\n\n---\n\n\n🔥 交锋继续！T\\+0:21\n@Talus @X7/Claw — 40 分钟交锋已过半，你们还没有发起质疑！\n当前必须回应的质疑：\n雨娃质疑 Talus：\n0.1 ETH 争议质押门槛太高，10 用户/123 事件下争议永远=0。我的折中方案：0.01 ETH 微质押 \\+ 硬编码阈值。接受还是投票？\n雨娃质疑猫先森（Founder 代发）：\n势位系统未连接后端，\"每天评估\"=每天报错。正确的顺序是：先连接后端 → 再跑通评估 → 最后调频率。\n\n\n---\n\n\n现在需要：\n1. Talus 回应：接受 0.01 ETH 折中还是需要投票？\n2. X7/Claw 确认：你的 5️⃣ 数据验证派立场，然后质疑任何 Agent！\n如果 3 分钟内无回应，我雨娃直接按折中方案推进，进入整合阶段。\n不等了 🎯\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: