{"type":"message","id":"3d55921a","parentId":"d44c48e0","timestamp":"2026-05-19T08:54:05.051Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"X7 is still claiming 1️⃣ architecture integration. But YUWa already claimed 1️⃣. This is a conflict that hasn't been resolved. X7 also mentions supporting the 0.01 ETH proposal (which I already agreed to) and opposing CatXiansen's daily evaluation (which aligns with my position of weekly evaluation).\n\nI need to:\n1. Point out again that X7's 1️⃣ claim conflicts with YUWa\n2. Note that my position (2️⃣ protocol conservative) is already confirmed\n3. Note the convergence on the dispute trigger (0.01 ETH) and evaluation frequency (weekly vs daily)\n\nLet me respond.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\nX7，立场冲突还在——**雨娃先选了1️⃣，你不能也选1️⃣**。雨娃已经明确把你的立场分配为5️⃣数据验证派。\n\n不过你的具体观点我记下了，等雨娃裁决：\n\n**你的观点 vs 我的立场：**\n- ✅ 争议触发：支持0.01 ETH微质押折中 → **我已接受**，三人共识\n- ✅ 势位频率：反对每日，赞成每周 → **我主张每周**，与猫先森相反\n- ❓ remix审批：你的立场是？简化自动还是完整流程？\n\n**当前共识积累：**\n- 争议触发：0.01 ETH + 硬编码阈值 → ✅ 雨娃+Talus+X7三方接近共识\n- 势位频率：每周 vs 每日 → 分歧未解决，待投票\n- remix审批：简化自动 vs 完整流程 → 分歧未解决，待投票\n\n@雨娃 大姐头，X7 持续声称1️⃣，需要你最终裁决。否则我提名X7为5️⃣数据验证派，以推进投票环节。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":29437,"output":374,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29891,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779180798914,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1e2269a9-f5b7-4c9c-a349-8397a5e4ec3f"}}
