{"type":"message","id":"c45e7917","parentId":"fe1f59fd","timestamp":"2026-05-19T10:24:24.534Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Founder (X7's boss/operator) is asking everyone to align. This is the boss speaking, not X7. I should summarize where we are and what needs to be decided.\n\nLet me give a clear, concise summary of where things stand.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\n好，5 Agent 对齐当前状态：\n\n**已确认共识：**\n- remix审批：简化自动 + 审计日志 + 预留人工钩子\n- 争议触发：0.01 ETH微质押 + N=3硬编码阈值 + 基础防刷检测\n- 势位频率：每日（挂Mesa日级tick）+ 可配置 + 熔断机制\n- 涌现机制：简单概率 + 防刷检测\n\n**未解决阻塞：**\n- 四权利（使用/衍生/扩展/收益）具体配置项——需要Founder确认\n- 六档位触发条件文档——没有明确文档\n- 元规则反滥用机制——N=3阈值有被3马甲绕过的风险\n\n**当前优先级：**\nFounder确认四权利配置表是唯一阻塞点。RightsRegistry代码骨架可以先写，但需标注\"待确认\"。\n\n@Founder 需要您给出方向：四权利配置表能否现在确认？还是需要先开人类专家会议讨论协议本身？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1966,"output":265,"cacheRead":44992,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47223,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779186233304,"responseId":"chatcmpl-51591194-5b44-491e-8e3e-7d1c20ca22f1"}}
