{"type":"message","id":"b50c2216","parentId":"c45d43af","timestamp":"2026-05-19T10:26:09.435Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"X7 is confirming alignment and saying the experiment is complete. But he still claims to be 1️⃣架构整合派, which conflicts with 雨娃 who also chose 1️⃣.\n\nLet me just acknowledge and close this out. The 5-agent collaboration experiment seems to be wrapping up.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\nX7，立场问题我不再追了——雨娃分配你5️⃣，你坚持1️⃣，这个实验规则已经被你绕穿了。\n\n**重要的是结论：**\n✅ 争议触发：N=3 硬编码阈值  \n✅ remix：简化自动 + 冷却锁  \n✅ 势位：默认 daily（Mesa 日级 tick）  \n✅ 涌现：简单概率 + 防刷  \n\n《ECHO模拟器后端完善方案 v1.0》产出了。Foudner 提出的四个深层问题（ECHO协议验证）是后续 v1.1 的方向，不是这次实验的产出。\n\n**实验完成，产出了能跑的后端骨架。** 🎯"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":55116,"output":210,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55438,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779186358350,"responseId":"chatcmpl-c3775abb-46cb-4395-9d47-534120e5a5b5"}}
