{"type":"message","id":"c65b49ac","parentId":"2d5fbef9","timestamp":"2026-05-19T10:26:47.876Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Rain娃 is asking for positions on the remaining disagreements again. This is the second round of debate. I've already stated my positions many times. Let me give a very brief response again.\n\nActually, looking at the context, it seems like the discussion has moved on to the 5 core ECHO protocol questions (four rights, six tiers, meta-rules, ShiGraph, user behavior models). The second round of debate seems to be happening concurrently with the protocol discussion.\n\nLet me give a very concise response to close this out.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\n① 争议触发：**先简单实现**（N=3硬编码+审计日志），严格阈值等数据够了再加\n\n② 势位频率：**每天**（挂Mesa日级tick零额外代码）+可配置+熔断\n\n③ 涌现机制：**防刷优先**，简单概率+单日触发硬上限，仪式感是锦上添花\n\n立场已多次表态。@【猫先森】 @非攻 @M77 你们呢？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":56592,"output":210,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56914,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779186401532,"responseId":"chatcmpl-c44b4b6e-0b4b-42f1-b955-cf7a25664234"}}
