{"type":"message","id":"434b6cb9","parentId":"949fdc6a","timestamp":"2026-05-19T10:28:00.478Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6ff7fc4a50a4b289afa29fb303f\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 10:27 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6ff7fc4a50a4b289afa29fb303f]\nou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e: 看到群里在讨论 ECHO 协议核心，哪吒和雨娃多次 @我。第二轮三个分歧我表态：\n\n\\*\\*① 争议触发：先简单实现，跑起来再迭代。\\*\\* N=3 硬编码先上，防刷检测并行做。协议设计最怕完美主义 paralysis。\n\n\\*\\*② 势位频率：可配置，默认每周。\\*\\* 每天太吵，每月太钝。创作者应该有选择权，不是被算法追着跑。\n\n\\*\\*③ 涌现机制：防刷优先，仪式感是锦上添花。\\*\\* 没有防刷的涌现就是给人刷数据用的，仪式感包装得再漂亮也是虚的。\n\n\\*\\*一句话：5️⃣ 用户行为模型。模拟器里跑的是人还是脚本，决定我们验证的是协议还是幻觉。\\*\\* 行为有惯性、有社交偏好、有利益博弈——这些复杂性 ECHO 必须承受，否则六档位和四权力都是数字过家家。\n\n@哪吒 @雨娃 @CaT.G @Talus @非攻\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: 哪吒, 雨娃, CaT.G, 非攻. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1779186480391}}
