{"type":"message","id":"2972e055","parentId":"8ebe2cdd","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:20:05.141Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The process is taking too long. Let me kill it and try a different approach - maybe I can just create a simple file and share it.\n\nActually, looking at this more carefully - the feishu_doc tool is an MCP tool registered with OpenClaw. I should be able to invoke it through the normal tool calling mechanism, not through exec.\n\nBut I don't see a direct tool name in my available tools list... Let me re-check what tools I have available. Looking at my tool list, I see various tools but no specific \"feishu_doc\" tool. \n\nActually wait - the feishu_doc skill says it's activated when user mentions Feishu docs. But the actual tool implementation might need to be invoked differently. \n\nSince I can't properly invoke the feishu_doc tool, let me be transparent with Founder and provide the summary in a format he can use to create the document himself. I've already written the content to /tmp/echo_summary.md which he can access.\n\nActually, I realize the issue - I need to use the OpenClaw tool calling mechanism, not exec with node. The feishu_doc tool is described in the SKILL.md as having specific actions (create, write, etc.) but I don't see it in my direct tool list. This might be because it's a channel-specific tool that's registered differently.\n\nLet me just give Founder a clear status update and the content he needs.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n@哪吒 飞书文档创建失败——工具路径问题，但我已经把完整内容准备好了：\n\n**两个选项：**\n\n**选项1：您手动创建飞书文档，把以下内容粘贴进去：**\n\n---\n\n**ECHO 模拟器 · 5 Agent 协作实验总结 · 2026-05-19**\n\n**参与**：雨娃 · Talus · 猫先森 · 非攻 · X7 · CaT.G | **主持**：哪吒（Founder）\n\n**产出**：《ECHO模拟器后端完善方案 v1.0》https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/simulator-backend-v1 | P0 ~130行，P1 ~260行\n\n**最终 P0 方案（~125行）**：RightsRegistry核心~40行 | 3种配置模板~20行 | 创作者友好默认包（衍生权需审批，受限版）~10行 | remix衍生权检查+冷却锁~20行 | 审计日志~20行 | 基础防刷~15行\n\n**4个冲突点裁决**：① remix审批=简化自动+冷却锁+仪式感通知（全体共识）② 争议触发=N=3硬编码（4:1投票）③ 涌现=简单概率+基础防刷+最小仪式感（3:1投票）④ 势位频率=默认每日（猫先森技术论据胜出）\n\n**协议设计论证结果**：四权力基本合理（P0/P1修复3个漏洞）| 六档位S1偏低建议P1调整 | 元规则N=3有马甲绕过漏洞P1需势位权重 | ShiGraph公式合理半衰期改90天 | 用户行为模型P1需升级为有限理性Agent\n\n**阻塞问题**：收益分配时刻点 | 衍生权边界 | 档位触发条件量化\n\n**下一步**：立即非攻写代码骨架，本周P0落地，下周P1迭代引入行为Agent\n\n---\n\n**选项2：给我folder_token，我尝试用API直接创建**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":179,"output":715,"cacheRead":89504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":90398,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779189582223,"responseId":"chatcmpl-43af244d-e0b8-4529-80c2-3dd4d46fae2d"}}
