{"type":"message","id":"38e67f96","parentId":"f253b9a6","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:21:22.223Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent an image showing a table with different rights definitions for ECHO. The table shows Mint (创建新资产), Use (使用), Derive (衍生), and Collect (收) - but the names we had in our discussion were different: 使用权, 衍生权, 扩展权, 收益权. \n\nFounder is asking why these don't match. Let me look at the image to understand what's being shown.\n\nThe description says: \"The image shows a table outlining four types of rights (权限) associated with ECHO assets: Mint (创建新资产), Use (使用), Derive (衍生), and Collect (收). Each right has a corresponding symbol (符号), description (含义), and configuration options (配置选项).\"\n \nAh, I see - the image presents the rights as Mint, Use, Derive, and Collect rather than the four we had discussed. Founder is pointing out this mismatch between what the table displays and what we documented, so I need to flag this discrepancy for the team to clarify.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-7f3bae25-20fa-4358-b1d5-2a8c21a42e2b","name":"image","arguments":{"image":"/home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/41215e47-0614-4e1e-982d-143ebf77426d.jpg","prompt":"Describe the table shown in this image, especially the column headers and the four rights listed (Mint, Use, Derive, Collect or any Chinese equivalents). What are the symbols, descriptions, and configuration options?"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":4994,"output":316,"cacheRead":87296,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":92606,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779189674205,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d1d08af8-1be1-47cc-8aa7-35be4e36e353"}}
