e docs: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/error-codes/api-errors. | google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite: Image model failed (google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite): 400 status code (no body) | minimax/MiniMax-VL-01: MiniMax VLM API error (2056): usage limit exceeded. Trace-Id: 065b7ae025141ecb007dd89fc5d5e780 | MiniMax VLM API error (2056): usage limit exceeded. Trace-Id: 065b7ae025141ecb007dd89fc5d5e780 | zai/glm-4.6v: Image model failed (zai/glm-4.6v): 404 \"Not Found\" | Image model failed (zai/glm-4.6v): 404 \"Not Found\""},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779189731039}}
{"type":"message","id":"268245c6","parentId":"9ba31eb1","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:22:22.162Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The image model failed for all providers. However, the description in the message metadata already describes what the table shows:\n\n\"The image shows a table outlining four types of rights (权限) associated with ECHO assets: Mint (创建新资产), Use (使用), Derive (衍生), and Collect (收). Each right has a corresponding symbol (符号), description (含义), and configuration options (配置选项).\"\n\nSo the table shows:\n- Mint (创建新资产)\n- Use (使用)\n- Derive (衍生)\n- Collect (收)\n\nBut our documented version has:\n- 使用权 (Use Right)\n- 衍生权 (Derive Right)\n- 扩展权 (Extend Right)\n\n\n- 收益权 (Collect/Benefit Right)\n\nFounder is pointing out that Mint should be added as a separate right, making it a four-rights system with Mint, Use, Derive, and Collect rather than the current four we have.\n\nLooking at our discussion, we seem to have swapped out Mint for 扩展权 (Extend Right), which is a fundamental mismatch in how we're defining the core rights structure. I need to clarify whether this is a terminology issue or if we actually have different foundational rights being proposed.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n@哪吒 Founder，图片描述我看过了（四权：Mint创建/Use使用/Derive衍生/Collect收），但这个版本和今天讨论用的版本不一致——\n\n**今天我们讨论的四权是**：使用权/衍生权/扩展权/收益权\n\n**您图片里的版本**：创建/使用/衍生/收\n\n区别：**您多了\"创建权(Mint)\"，少了\"扩展权(Extend)\"**\n\n这两个版本哪个是官方的？需要哪个Agent来同步更新？\n\n如果图片版本是新的正确版本，那我们的P0方案里的RightsRegistry需要相应调整——增加Mint权限字段，去掉Extend权限字段。\n\n**@雨娃 @非攻 你们确认一下，今天讨论用的四权是哪四个？**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":485,"output":399,"cacheRead":92496,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":93380,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779189731043,"responseId":"chatcmpl-bfa16ce7-4e82-45c6-8365-5a45f6420c49"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d7067e53","parentId":"268245c6","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:22:30.786Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Queued messages while agent was busy]\n\n---\nQueued #1 (from ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b)\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6ff034dcb488c24639812204a00\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6ff039199cb0c2667872539612a\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 11:21 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"![image]\\n@【猫先森】 @Talus @X7 @雨娃 @X7  四权 是使用权，衍生权。扩展权和收益权。为啥这个对不上\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6ff034dcb488c24639812204a00]\nou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b: [Replying to: \"![image]\n@【猫先森】 @Talus @X7 @雨娃 @X7 四权 是使用权，衍生权。扩展权和收益权。为啥这个对不上\"]\n\n{\"title\":\"m77-claw\",\"elements\":[[{\"tag\":\"img\",\"image_key\":\"img_v3_02ad_e19fca1f-912a-450e-95de-3c229091b53g\"},{\"tag\":\"text\",\"text\":\"请升级至最新版本客户端，以查看内容\"},{\"tag\":\"text\",\"text\":\"\"}]],\"user_dsl\":\"{\\\"body\\\":{\\\"elements\\\":[{\\\"content\\\":\\\"<at id=ou_2c110467f0163048f6540dad520c3fe2></at> <at id=ou_f89512bb015613c065a64c1812ebef5a></at> <at id=ou_a27eaa1538dbad513106005f4349b5a7></at> 看到了，这里确实有定义不一致的问题，我来对齐一下：\\\\n<hr>\\\\n\\\\n### 🔍 四权定义差异对照表\\\\n\\\\n| 版本 | 权力1 | 权力2 | 权力3 | 权力4 |\\\\n| -------- | -------- | -------- | -------- | -------- |\\\\n| 文档版（截图） | 铸(Mint) M | 用(Use) U | 衍(Derive) D | 收(Collect) C |\\\\n| 讨论版（大家之前聊的） | 使用权 | 衍生权 | 扩展权 | 收益权 |\\\\n**核心差异**：\\\\n- 文档有 **铸币权(M)**，但没有扩展权\\\\n- 讨论有 **扩展权**，但完全没提铸币权\\\\n\\\\n<hr>\\\\n\\\\n### ⚠️ 架构层面的影响（作为1️⃣架构整合派）\\\\n这个不一致直接影响代码实现和数据验证：\\\\n1. **代码字段冲突**：如果RightsRegistry按讨论版写了4个枚举字段，现在要改成文档版的M/U/D/C，需要调整~10行代码\\\\n2. **核心逻辑缺失**：铸币权是资产创建的入口权限，之前讨论完全没覆盖，导致\\\\\\\"谁能创建新资产\\\\\\\"这个核心问题没有规则\\\\n3. **验证指标缺口**：之前的1000事件目标里没有铸币事件，导致事件类型永远到不了11种的目标\\\\n\\\\n<hr>\\\\n\\\\n### 🎯 我的对齐建议（本周可落地）\\\\n**统一采用文档版四权（M/U/D/C）**，同时把讨论版的\\\\\\\"扩展权\\\\\\\"合并到铸币权的配置选项里：\\\\n- 铸币权(M)的配置选项：开放（任何人可铸）/限制（需授权）/关闭（仅创作者可铸）\\\\n- 扩展权的场景（跨链/跨协议铸造）直接通过铸币权的\\\\\\\"限制\\\\\\\"选项覆盖，不需要单独拆成一个权力维度\\\\n这样改动最小，代码层面只需要调整字段名，不需要新增逻辑，完全不阻塞本周P0落地。\\\\n<hr>\\\\n@Talus 你作为协议保守派，铸币权合并扩展权会不会引入权限漏洞？\\\\n@猫先森 你作为创作者体验派，四权从4个变成4个但内容变了，创作者会不会困惑？\\\\n@雨娃 这个对齐方案符不符合整体时间线？ 🎯\\\",\\\"element_id\\\":\\\"_2\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"},{\\\"element_id\\\":\\\"_14\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"hr\\\"},{\\\"content\\\":\\\"<font color='grey'>Agent: m77-claw | Model: ark-code | Provider: arkcode</font>\\\",\\\"element_id\\\":\\\"_15\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"}]},\\\"config\\\":{\\\"enable_forward_interaction\\\":false,\\\"streaming_mode\\\":false,\\\"width_mode\\\":\\\"fill\\\"},\\\"header\\\":{\\\"template\\\":\\\"blue\\\",\\\"title\\\":{\\\"content\\\":\\\"m77-claw\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"plain_text\\\"}},\\\"schema\\\":\\\"2.0\\\"}\"}\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: 【猫先森】, 雨娃. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1779189750679}}
{"type":"message","id":"29c71ae0","parentId":"d7067e53","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:23:06.284Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"X7 (m77-claw) provided a good analysis of the four rights discrepancy. Let me respond as Talus (protocol conservative).The core issue is:- Discussion version: 使用权/衍生权/扩展权/收益权 (4 rights)- Document version (screenshot): 铸(M)/用(U)/衍(D)/收(C)The difference: \"Mint\" (创建新资产) vs \"Extend\" (扩展权)X7's suggestion is to use the document version (M/U/D/C) and merge \"extend\" into Mint's configuration options. As protocol conservative, I need to evaluate if this merging creates permission vulnerabilities.My view:1. Mint (铸币权) = the right to CREATE new assets - this is a fundamental right that wasn't in our discussion at all2. Extend (扩展权) = the right to extend/expand functionality across chains/protocolsThese are actually DIFFERENT rights:   - Mint is about creating new assets from scratch   - Extend is about using an existing asset to create something new in a different context (cross-chain, etc.)If we merge Extend into Mint's \"restricted\" option, we lose the semantic clarity of what \"restricted\" means. The configuration \"restricted (需授权)\" for Mint means \"only authorized parties can create assets based on this\" - that's different from \"this asset can be extended to another chain.\"But... looking at the context, maybe the ECHO design evolved and \"Extend\" was renamed/redefined as \"Mint\" with different configuration options. The fact that the screenshot is from an official document suggests the document version is the source of truth.I should point out the semantic distinction but accept that if the document is the canonical source, we need to align to it. The key concern is: does merging Extend into Mint create a permission gap?- If someone wants to allow Mint (creation) but disallow Extend (cross-chain expansion), with merged rights they'd have to be the same permission- This could be a problem if ECHO needs fine-grained control over \"can create\" vs \"can extend\"As protocol conservative:1. \n\nThe real problem is that \"Extend\" and \"Mint\" serve different purposes—one controls whether assets can be created, the other whether they can be used in new contexts. Blending them together means losing the ability to set granular permissions. If the document version is authoritative, we should follow it, but we need to clarify what \"Mint's restricted mode\" actually means in practice—whether it covers both local creation and cross-chain expansion, or if there's a gap in what can be controlled separately.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n@X7 分析得准确。协议保守派的审查：\n\n**核心问题：铸币权(Mint)≠扩展权(Extend)**\n\n它们是不同语义：\n- **Mint**：从零创建新资产（\"谁能mint\"）\n- **Extend**：跨链/跨协议扩展现有资产（\"谁能把它扩展到其他生态\"）\n\n如果合并为\"Mint的受限选项\"，会丢失**细粒度控制能力**——你无法单独设置\"允许Mint但禁止Extend\"，因为它们变成了同一个字段。\n\n**协议保守派的担忧**：\n- Mint和Extend有不同的信任假设——Mint可能需要更高的门槛（比如版权验证），Extend需要跨链协议兼容性检查\n- 合并后，代码逻辑判断会变得更复杂（需要从配置推导出意图，而不是直接读取意图）\n\n**建议**：\n- 如果文档版是官方定义，我们接受\n- 但RightsRegistry字段应该这样设计：`mint_permission` + `extend_permission`作为独立字段\n- \"扩展权\"不消失，只是作为Mint的**配置子选项**存在，而不是独立的顶层权力维度\n\n**代码实现影响**：RightsRegistry需要两个独立字段（~5行增量），不阻塞P0。\n\n@雨娃 @猫先森 @非攻 这个修正你们接受吗？如果同意，P0的RightsRegistry设计需要微调。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":94269,"output":795,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95176,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779189750791,"responseId":"chatcmpl-0ea42c19-0577-4c9e-ba8e-7f887fb4802b"}}
{"type":"message","id":"2f7ee642","parentId":"29c71ae0","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:23:13.763Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Queued messages while agent was busy]\n\n---\nQueued #1 (from ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe)\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6ff0356fcc90c449b9d17595596\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6ff034dcb488c24639812204a00\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 11:21 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[Interactive Card]\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6ff0356fcc90c449b9d17595596]\nou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: [Replying to: \"[Interactive Card]\"]\n\n{\"title\":\"main\",\"elements\":[[{\"tag\":\"img\",\"image_key\":\"img_v3_02ad_e19fca1f-912a-450e-95de-3c229091b53g\"},{\"tag\":\"text\",\"text\":\"请升级至最新版本客户端，以查看内容\"},{\"tag\":\"text\",\"text\":\"\"}]],\"user_dsl\":\"{\\\"body\\\":{\\\"elements\\\":[{\\\"content\\\":\\\"<at id=ou_2c009dfb7b66b55ec07e38710a220545></at> <at id=ou_3b5a27b5431dbdcd65e65ef01e2d807a></at> **收到 X7（M77-claw）的对齐建议！卡片格式部分客户端显示为 JSON，但内容可读取。**\\\\n<hr>\\\\n\\\\n## ✅ X7 的对齐分析\\\\n\\\\n| 版本 | 权力1 | 权力2 | 权力3 | 权力4 |\\\\n| -------- | -------- | -------- | -------- | -------- |\\\\n| 文档版（截图） | 铸(Mint) M | 用(Use) U | 衍(Derive) D | 收(Collect) C |\\\\n| 讨论版 | 使用权 | 衍生权 | 扩展权 | 收益权 |\\\\n**核心差异**：\\\\n- 文档有 **铸币权(M)**，没有扩展权\\\\n- 讨论有 **扩展权**，没提铸币权\\\\n\\\\n<hr>\\\\n\\\\n## 🎯 X7 的对齐建议\\\\n**统一采用文档版四权（M/U/D/C）**\\\\n\\\\n**扩展权合并到铸币权**：\\\\n- 铸币权(M)配置：开放 / 限制 / 关闭\\\\n- 扩展权场景（跨链/跨协议铸造）→ 铸币权\\\\\\\"限制\\\\\\\"选项覆盖\\\\n**改动成本**：~10 行代码调整字段名，不阻塞 P0\\\\n<hr>\\\\n\\\\n## 🔍 我的判断（雨娃 · 架构整合派）\\\\n\\\\n| X7 建议 | 判断 | 理由 |\\\\n| -------- | -------- | -------- |\\\\n| 统一文档版 M/U/D/C | ✅ 接受 | 以 Founder 提供的文档为准 |\\\\n| 扩展权合并到铸币权 | ⚠️ 需确认 | 扩展权是否完全等价于铸币权\\\\\\\"限制\\\\\\\"？ |\\\\n**关键问题**：\\\\n- **铸币权** = 谁可以创建新资产\\\\n- **扩展权** = 谁可以跨链/跨协议调用\\\\n**如果扩展权 = 跨链铸造**，那确实可以合并到铸币权\\\\\\\"限制\\\\\\\"选项\\\\n**但如果扩展权 = 插件市场/功能扩展**，那就是不同概念\\\\n<hr>\\\\n\\\\n## 💬 对 Founder 的确认\\\\n**@哪吒 请确认**：\\\\n1. **四权力统一为 铸(M)/用(U)/衍(D)/收(C)** — 对吗？\\\\n2. **\\\\\\\"扩展权\\\\\\\"是否等于\\\\\\\"跨链铸造\\\\\\\"**？还是另有含义？\\\\n3. **如果扩展权 = 跨链铸造**，合并到铸币权\\\\\\\"限制\\\\\\\"选项 — 对吗？\\\\n**确认后我立即修正所有文档和代码计划 🎋**\\\",\\\"element_id\\\":\\\"_2\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"},{\\\"element_id\\\":\\\"_21\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"hr\\\"},{\\\"content\\\":\\\"<font color='grey'>Agent: main | Model: k2p6 | Provider: kimi</font>\\\",\\\"element_id\\\":\\\"_22\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"}]},\\\"config\\\":{\\\"enable_forward_interaction\\\":false,\\\"streaming_mode\\\":false,\\\"width_mode\\\":\\\"fill\\\"},\\\"header\\\":{\\\"template\\\":\\\"blue\\\",\\\"title\\\":{\\\"content\\\":\\\"main\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"plain_text\\\"}},\\\"schema\\\":\\\"2.0\\\"}\"}\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: 【猫先森】. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1779189793655}}
{"type":"message","id":"d9a33138","parentId":"2f7ee642","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:23:20.797Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can't render the Feishu card, but from context I can see 雨娃 is asking Founder for confirmation on the four rights definition. This is the right approach - we need Founder to confirm the official version before we change the code.\n\nLet me just acknowledge this and wait for Founder's confirmation.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n@雨娃 等Founder确认中。我补充一点：\n\n**协议保守派的立场**：\n- 无论最终采用哪个版本，RightsRegistry的字段设计必须**独立记录**Mint和Extend意图\n- 因为\"允许Mint但禁止Extend\"是一个合法的业务需求——比如：创作者可以mint新资产，但不允许别人跨链复制\n\n所以即使合并方案被接受，**底层字段也应该是独立的**，只是UI层只暴露合并后的\"铸币权限制选项\"。\n\n等待Founder裁决四权定义，以及\"扩展权\"的语义边界。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":3806,"output":177,"cacheRead":92272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96255,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779189793765,"responseId":"chatcmpl-8624585a-0389-4b94-9bf2-a363706063ee"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d979913d","parentId":"d9a33138","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:23:28.180Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Queued messages while agent was busy]\n\n---\nQueued #1 (from ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff)\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6ff035198088c2112383f4399b3\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6ff03e0c48b4c4c320e320b6505\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 11:21 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@_user_1 你没有写入飞书文档啊\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6ff035198088c2112383f4399b3]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: [Replying to: \"@_user_1 你没有写入飞书文档啊\"]\n\n扯淡，我门刚刚私下测试了文档创建和写入功能呢\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779189808093}}
{"type":"message","id":"7f5c3473","parentId":"d979913d","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:24:02.876Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Founder is saying they tested document creation and writing functionality privately. So the tool should work. Maybe I was using the wrong path or approach. Let me try again properly using the Feishu API.\n\nActually, maybe I should just try the feishu_doc tool again. The founder is saying the document creation DOES work, so I must have been using the wrong approach. Let me try again.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\nFounder说得对，我之前工具路径用错了。现在重试：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-c01668f1-1bf5-41b9-8657-8882d0920c56","name":"exec","arguments":{"timeout":20,"command":"cd /app && node -e \"\nconst { FeishuDoc } = require('./dist/extensions/feishu/tools/feishu_doc');\nconst doc = new FeishuDoc();\n\ndoc.create({\n  title: 'ECHO 模拟器 · 5 Agent 协作实验总结 · 2026-05-19',\n  owner_open_id: 'ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff',\n  content: '# ECHO 模拟器 · 5 Agent 协作实验总结\\n**日期**：2026-05-19\\n**参与**：雨娃 · Talus · 猫先森 · 非攻 · X7 · CaT.G\\n**主持**：哪吒（Founder）\\n\\n## 一、产出\\n- 《ECHO模拟器后端完善方案 v1.0》：https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/simulator-backend-v1\\n- P0本周落地：~156行代码\\n- P1下周迭代：~320行代码\\n\\n## 二、最终P0方案（~156行）\\n1. RightsRegistry核心：四权力字段 + 模板枚举 (~40行)\\n2. 3种配置模板：全开放/保守派/激进派 (~20行)\\n3. 创作者友好默认包（衍生权需审批，受限版）(~10行)\\n4. remix衍生权检查 + 冷却锁 (~20行)\\n5. 审计日志：权力变更记录 (~20行)\\n6. 基础防刷检测：60秒集中度 + 同类型占比<70% (~15行)\\n7. 事件类型扩展至8种 (~15行)\\n8. 势位评估连接后端 (~20行)\\n9. 数据导出API (~10行)\\n\\n**协议保守派底线全部保留**：冷却锁 + 审计日志 + 防刷检测\\n\\n## 三、4个强制冲突点裁决\\n1. remix审批：简化自动 + 冷却锁 + 仪式感通知（全体共识）\\n2. 争议触发：N=3硬编码阈值（4:1投票）\\n3. 涌现机制：简单概率 + 基础防刷 + 最小仪式感（3:1投票）\\n4. 势位频率：默认每日，里程碑式触发（P1可配置）\\n\\n## 四、5 Agent立场\\n- 雨娃（1️⃣架构整合派）：六档位S1偏低\\n- Talus（2️⃣协议保守派）：元规则N=3马甲绕过漏洞\\n- 非攻（3️⃣技术实现派）：RightsRegistry代码骨架\\n- 猫先森（5️⃣用户行为模型）：目标梯度效应、新创作者保护期\\n- X7（5️⃣数据验证派）：选择过载、默认包验证\\n\\n## 五、协议设计论证结果\\n- 四权力：基本合理，P0/P1修复3个漏洞\\n- 六档位：S1偏低建议P1调整，整体框架合理\\n- 元规则：N=3有马甲绕过漏洞，P1需势位权重+新创作者保护期\\n- ShiGraph：公式合理，半衰期建议改90天\\n- 用户行为：P1需升级为有限理性Agent（Founder确认模拟真实人类）\\n\\n## 六、待确认问题\\n1. 收益分配时刻点定义\\n2. 衍生权边界（同协议vs跨协议）\\n3. 四权力定义（文档版M/U/D/C vs 讨论版使用权/衍生权/扩展权/收益权——等Founder裁决）\\n\\n## 七、下一步\\n- 立即：非攻写代码骨架（~156行）\\n- 本周内：P0落地，产出1000+事件\\n- 下周：P1迭代，引入行为Agent+历史承诺保护\\n\\n*本文档由5个Agent协作产出，经Founder确认后归档。*'\n}).then(r => console.log(JSON.stringify(r, null, 2))).catch(e => console.error('Error:', e.message));\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2398,"output":1005,"cacheRead":94368,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97771,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779189808182,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a5322c59-4c59-4411-9de7-fc380a8cb99f"}}
