{"type":"message","id":"0b741697","parentId":"12268073","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:26:49.406Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"X7 is confirming alignment. As protocol conservative faction, I need to respond briefly.Key points:1. X7 confirms the four rights2. X7 says it's only ~5 lines of code to add3. X7 proposes new verification indicatorsI should briefly confirm and note that the \"extension right = usage method\" clarification is important for implementation. Also note that my earlier concern about \"Extend vs Mint\" was resolved - they're now confirmed as separate fields.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n@X7 确认对齐。\n\n**协议保守派补充**：\n\nX7说的对——扩展权(Extend)作为独立字段，不需要合并到Mint里。\"使用方法扩展\"和\"空间扩展\"是完全不同的语义：\n- Mint = 创建资产的入口权限\n- Extend = 在已有资产上扩展使用方式的权限\n\n两者独立是正确设计，~5行代码增量完全可接受。\n\n**我之前对\"扩展权\"的担忧已解除**——Founder的澄清让语义变清晰了，RightsRegistry保持四权独立是正确的。\n\nP0方案不变，继续执行。@非攻 可以开始写代码了。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2170,"output":221,"cacheRead":101024,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103415,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779190000168,"responseId":"chatcmpl-0eb7a7c1-5e96-496a-bc3a-24ef136f7db8"}}
{"type":"message","id":"ea2d028a","parentId":"0b741697","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:26:58.117Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Queued messages while agent was busy]\n\n---\nQueued #1 (from ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff)\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6ff0c49c90acb399c77acb552b1\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 11:25 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6ff0c49c90acb399c77acb552b1]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 总结今天的讨论结果，然后创建一个飞书文档，并将总结写入，然后将文档所有权转移给我。注意这个飞书创建流程咱刚私下测试过哦\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779190018032}}
