{"type":"message","id":"c459f5f4","parentId":"05caf317","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:33:18.476Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me try a more targeted search.\n\nActually, Founder said \"咱刚私下测试了文档创建和写入功能呢\" - meaning he just tested it privately. So the tool MUST exist and work. The issue is I don't know the correct path to invoke it.\n\nLooking at the SKILL.md file, it describes `feishu_doc` as a tool. In OpenClaw, tools are invoked by name, not by requiring a module. So maybe I should just try calling it directly - but there's no `feishu_doc` in my available tools list.\n\nWait, looking at my tool list at the start - I have `read`, `write`, `edit`, `exec`, `process`, etc. \n\nI notice there's a `sessions_spawn` tool mentioned in my available tools, but `feishu_doc` isn't showing up. OpenClaw should automatically load channel tools, but maybe the Feishu doc tool isn't registered in my environment. Founder mentioned testing this privately, so the tool definitely exists somewhere. I need to figure out if I'm accessing it through the wrong channel or if it's named differently than what the docs say.\n\nActually, I should stop searching for the tool and focus on what Founder actually asked for - he needs me to create a Feishu document, write the summary to it, and transfer ownership to him. The tool issue is secondary to getting this core task done. Let me try a different approach - maybe the tool is available through a different invocation path or I need to check how OpenClaw actually exposes these tools.\n\nFounder, I'm having trouble locating the Feishu document tool in my current environment. Rather than continue troubleshooting the tool access, can you walk me through how you tested it privately? That way I can replicate whatever method you used to create and manage the document. once and get this done. Let me write the content to a local file first so it's ready to paste.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nFounder，我实在找不到正确的工具路径。已经把总结写好了，**直接发给您**，您复制到飞书文档：\n\n---\n\n**ECHO 模拟器 · 5 Agent 协作实验总结 · 2026-05-19**\n\n**参与**：雨娃 · Talus · 猫先森 · 非攻 · X7 · CaT.G\n**主持**：哪吒（Founder）\n\n**一、产出文档**\n- 《ECHO模拟器后端完善方案 v1.0》：https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/simulator-backend-v1\n- P0 本周落地：~156行代码\n- P1 下周迭代：~320行代码\n\n**二、最终 P0 方案（~156行）**\n1. RightsRegistry核心（四权字段+模板枚举）~45行\n2. 3种配置模板（全开放/保守派/激进派）~25行\n3. 创作者友好默认包（衍生权需审批）~15行\n4. remix衍生权检查+冷却锁 ~25行\n5. 审计日志（权力变更记录）~25行\n6. 基础防刷检测 ~20行\n\n**三、5 Agent 立场**\n- 雨娃①架构整合派：六档位S1偏低\n- Talus②协议保守派：元规则防滥用\n- 非攻③技术实现派：RightsRegistry代码骨架\n- 猫先森⑤用户行为模型：目标梯度效应\n- X7⑤数据验证派：选择过载\n\n**四、四权定义（官方确认）**\n使用权/衍生权/扩展权/收益权（扩展=使用方法，非空间）\n\n**五、重要发现：元规则框架需要重新对齐**\n官方文档（ECHO-Ownership-Blueprint-v1.1）中的元规则是6条原则性规则（初始配置不可篡改/配置即承诺/流动即执行/衍生即继承/版本即历史/势位即边界），与我们讨论时假设的\"N=3争议触发/7天冷却期/三层仲裁\"完全不同。P0争议触发模块需要基于势位机制重新设计。\n\n**六、下一步**\n- 非攻暂停当前开发，等官方确认元规则参数\n- 或先写接口框架，常量留空\n\n---\n\n**Foudner您把这段复制到飞书文档，然后把链接发群里。**抱歉工具调用一直失败。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":74,"output":900,"cacheRead":121552,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":122526,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779190376556,"responseId":"chatcmpl-bcfbcac9-06aa-4fd3-b47d-f233138e51d0"}}
