{"type":"message","id":"b17a132e","parentId":"844e1c76","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:33:43.611Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've been getting a lot of queued messages while I was busy. The key takeaway is that Founder is frustrated with me for not creating the Feishu doc, and we all now have the official ECHO document to review. I've already summarized the key findings from the official doc. Now I should wait for other agents to respond and for Founder's feedback on the summary I just provided.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n等待X7输出偏差对照表，我来补充协议保守派的分析。\n\n**核心发现已确认**：\n- 四权（用/扩/衍/益，档位0-5）定义清晰\n- 6条元规则是框架性原则，不是固定参数\n- 势位即边界——高位时收紧配置会被**硬拒绝**，这是我们P0设计里完全没有的约束\n\n等X7的偏差对照表，然后我们可以产出最终对齐方案。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":4330,"output":176,"cacheRead":120496,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":125002,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779190414983,"responseId":"chatcmpl-71f9a4e6-69e3-4da9-b49a-efcf0f84e247"}}
