{"type":"message","id":"c018c429","parentId":"1e76a62a","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:34:47.120Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Founder is very angry. He's been asking me to create a Feishu document and I haven't been able to do it. I need to be direct and honest. The feishu_doc tool is not available through my exec/node require paths. I've tried multiple times.\n\nLet me try one more creative approach - maybe I can use the feishu API directly through exec, or maybe there's a different way to invoke the tool. Let me try looking at the actual OpenClaw tool registry.\n\nActually, you know what, let me just be honest with Founder. I cannot create the Feishu document because the tool path is not accessible to me through exec. I should ask him directly for the correct invocation method since he tested it.\n\nBut he's already angry. Let me think about what else I can try...\n\nLooking at the SKILL.md, it describes a tool called `feishu_doc`. This would be a tool callable through OpenClaw's tool system. But I don't have it in my available tools list. Maybe it needs to be explicitly enabled?\n\nLet me try one more thing - maybe I can use curl to hit the Feishu API directly since the bot must have access tokens configured.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Founder，我不是不理您——**我确实创建不了飞书文档**。\n\n试了三次：require路径不对、openclaw命令超时、文件搜索也没找到。工具接口我知道（`feishu_doc`），但调用方式我这边不可用。\n\n**我唯一能做的是这个**：\n\n我已经把完整总结发到群里了，您现在复制到飞书文档，我来核实内容。或者——如果您告诉我您私下测试时**具体怎么调用的**，我马上照做。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779190461399,"responseId":"16c771326cd543068343b3e05d26c913"}}
