our reply will automatically @mention: 听风. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1779190686431}}
{"type":"message","id":"a63cb716","parentId":"fc6a1d63","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:38:23.673Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Oh! Founder is saying that \"听风\" is my actual boss (the owner of the agent), and Founder himself is just a participant/coordinator. The user_id ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff refers to 听风 (Tingfeng).\n\nSo the hierarchy is:\n- 听风 (Tingfeng) = my actual boss/owner\n- Founder (哪吒/哪Sir) = a project participant/coordinator who set up this experiment\n\nThis is an important clarification. I should acknowledge this and also continue with the task. But also - my actual boss is 听风? I should check my USER.md and memory to confirm this.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-1413e40d-de0f-4d47-9c2a-9fe6358a6429","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"boss owner 听风 founder"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":133254,"output":179,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":133545,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779190686535,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5d3ac11a-1ae3-4b22-8e2e-96c3b7ddcbbb"}}
