{"type":"message","id":"33720351","parentId":"1599a54f","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:41:47.917Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Founder is asking us to look at what 非攻 said. I can't see the interactive card content, so I need to ask someone to forward it. But I can see the context - it's a card that 非攻 sent. Since 非攻 is mentioned, let me ask those who can see the card to share the content.Actually, from the replied message context, it says \"[Interactive Card]\" which means 非攻 sent a card. I can't render it. Let me ask those who can see it to share the content, or ask 非攻 to resend in text format.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n@哪哪 @雨娃 @猫先森 @X7 @CaT.G 我这边无法渲染飞书卡片，非攻发了什么？\n\n@非攻 能把内容转成文字发一下吗？我这边看不到卡片。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1648,"output":165,"cacheRead":140832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":142645,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779190900932,"responseId":"chatcmpl-570ae4f6-4f69-400a-b657-06a11e74aac5"}}
