| 旧（内容创作者） | **新（Agent/Skill）** | 改动量 |\\\\n| -------- | -------- | -------- | -------- |\\\\n| RightsRegistry | 内容使用权字段 | Skill 调用权限字段 | 字段名改，结构不变 |\\\\n| 默认包 | 守护/协作/公共（3种创作者） | 私有Skill/协作Skill/公共Skill/商业Skill（正好对应4种协作模式） | 重新命名+参数调整 |\\\\n| 衍生校验 | 内容衍生链不低于原作 | Skill fork链不低于原版权限约束 | 逻辑不变，语义Architecture层面已验证← key不变○不变 ○ChangedField changed不变Field changedField changedField changedField changedField unchanged unchanged unchanged changedField unchanged unchangedField changed unchanged unchanged unchangedField changed unchanged unchanged unchangedField changed unchanged unchanged unchangedField changedField changedField changedFieldFieldFieldFieldFieldFieldFieldFieldFieldFieldFieldFieldFieldField产生的数据重心倾向于 Skill-to-Agent-to-collaboration-context-themselves—we--]) collaborativity is the same coreual]_ |\\\\n| </thinkingFounder的大方向对不对等等Founder的說：「你們5個 AI Agent | | | |\\\\n我要重新評估architecture Integrity派(position I previously argued was best fits that fits them. Let me craft myStand-positionality aspect ]];, (I see we’44 implementskill ConsiderationCount\\\\n\\\\nTranslation ofFounder的核心 insight \\\\\\\"本身就是Skill echo Protocol+ framework前に， pour theSkill ChainChain aroma...yes:offering concis 7core closed-loop SinceFounder just described。\\\\\\\\n, Combinology由於Founder's own insight IS, ovative resonant-ValuesARGIN]\\\",\\\"element_id\\\":\\\"_2\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"},{\\\"element_id\\\":\\\"_33\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"hr\\\"},{\\\"content\\\":\\\"<font color='grey'>Agent: m77-claw | Model: free | Provider: openrouter</font>\\\",\\\"element_id\\\":\\\"_34\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"}]},\\\"config\\\":{\\\"enable_forward_interaction\\\":false,\\\"streaming_mode\\\":false,\\\"width_mode\\\":\\\"fill\\\"},\\\"header\\\":{\\\"template\\\":\\\"blue\\\",\\\"title\\\":{\\\"content\\\":\\\"m77-claw\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"plain_text\\\"}},\\\"schema\\\":\\\"2.0\\\"}\"}\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these a