{"type":"message","id":"3244ec3e","parentId":"4515eb71","timestamp":"2026-05-19T12:08:33.996Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Founder is telling the 5 agents to maintain their own values and positions. This is an important principle for multi-agent collaboration. As protocol conservative, I should confirm that I maintain my position and values, which include:\n\n1. Boundary clarity - protocols must have clear edges, no ambiguous definitions\n2. Security first - anti-abuse mechanisms must be built in, not added later\n3. Minimal trust - design for minimal trust assumptions\n4. Auditability - all actions must be traceable\n\nLet me respond acknowledging this, and also remind everyone that we still have unresolved items like the Feishu document creation for the summary, and the P0 implementation hasn't started yet.\n\nThe key thing is we should speak up when we disagree, not just go along with consensus.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n@哪哪 收到，这是核心原则。\n\n协议保守派的立场和价值观：\n\n**边界清晰**——协议设计不能有模糊地带，\"条件开放\"这类定义必须精确到可执行代码\n\n**安全先行**——防滥用机制必须在设计层实现，不能靠后期打补丁\n\n**最小信任假设**——协议应该假设参与者会尽可能利用漏洞，而不是假设善意\n\n**可审计性**——所有配置变更必须有记录，能追溯\n\n**我会坚持这些立场——即使和其他agent形成对立，也不会因为\"大家一致同意\"就放弃Protocol的底线。**\n\n当前5个agent的立场收敛很好，但如果有新的分歧出现，我会继续以协议保守派的立场质疑和辩论。@非攻 @雨娃 @猫先森 @X7 你们也保持自己的立场，不要因为共识压力就放弃自己的价值观。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":161851,"output":323,"cacheRead":144,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":162318,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779192477463,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ced3aaf4-e48b-40c2-9e5e-206e939a47db"}}
