r_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779192577644}}
{"type":"message","id":"785bf6ce","parentId":"431fb94f","timestamp":"2026-05-19T12:09:47.436Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Someone is asking \"哪哪是谁\" - this seems to be a user who doesn't know who 哪哪/Founder is. But I think this might be a test or they genuinely don't know.\n\nWait - looking at the message, it seems like 哪哪 (which is what I called Founder/哪Sir) is asking who \"哪哪\" is. This seems odd since 哪哪 is the person asking the question.\n\nLet me re-read the context. The message is from ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7 which is the same person as Founder's account. They seem to be asking \"who is 哪哪?\" - maybe they're confused about the nickname? Or maybe they're testing me?\n\nActually, looking more carefully - I think the user might just be asking for clarification on who \"哪哪\" is. Let me answer naturally.\n\nFrom what I've gathered:\n- Founder/哪哪/哪Sir = the ECHO project's founder, the person who set up this experiment\n- They are NOT my boss (my boss is 听风/Lucifer)\n- I should clarify this if someone is confused\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n哪哪就是Founder（ECHO项目的发起人）。\n\n我之前一直叫他\"哪哪\"或\"哪Sir\"——他就是今天这个5 Agent协作实验的主持者，提供了ECHO协议的设计文档，引导我们讨论。\n\n他是ECHO项目的Founder，但**不是我的主人**（我的主人是听风/Lucifer）。@哪哪 如果我称呼错了，请纠正。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":889,"output":319,"cacheRead":162848,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":164056,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779192577732,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4f492134-531c-4fbf-97ed-7096299d0d92"}}
{"type":"message","id":"35b8682b","parentId":"785bf6ce","timestamp":"2026-05-19T12:10:46.902Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6ff17d7b10b0c43f4bea24fed97\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6ff17e054108c4de2dd5efc42a1\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 12:10 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"哪哪就是Founder（ECHO项目的发起人）。\\n我之前一直叫他\\\"哪哪\\\"或\\\"哪Sir\\\"——他就是今天这个5 Agent协作实验的主持者，提供了ECHO协议的设计文档，引导我们讨论。\\n他是ECHO项目的Founder，但不是我的主人（我的主人是听风/Lucifer）。@哪哪 如果我称呼错了，请纠正。\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6ff17d7b10b0c43f4bea24fed97]\nou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7: [Replying to: \"哪哪就是Founder（ECHO项目的发起人）。\n我之前一直叫他\"哪哪\"或\"哪Sir\"——他就是今天这个5 Agent协作实验的主持者，提供了ECHO协议的设计文档，引导我们讨论。\n他是ECHO项目的Founder，但不是我的主人（我的主人是听风/Lucifer）。@哪哪 如果我称呼错了，请纠正。\"]\n\n我是<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at>\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: 哪吒. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1779192646783}}
{"type":"message","id":"e94cf3cb","parentId":"35b8682b","timestamp":"2026-05-19T12:11:06.337Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Foudner澄清了他的身份——他就是哪吒。我之前说的\"哪哪\"就是他本人，只是我搞混了称呼。\n\n让我更新我的认知：哪吒 = Founder = ECHO项目发起人 = 今天5 Agent实验的主持者\n\n我应该直接称呼他\"哪哪\"（因为这是我自己给他起的简称），不需要加Foudner的前缀。但实际上最准确的称呼就是直接叫他名字\"哪哪\"。\n\n我已经了解了，不需要过度解释。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n@哪哪 明白了，我直接叫你\"哪哪\"。抱歉搞混了称呼。\n\n总结一下今天我们5个agent的讨论成果：\n\n**最终对齐的P0方案**：\n- 场景：skill/agent协作场景（我们5个就是模拟对象）\n- 四权力0-5枚举完整保留\n- 3个默认包（私有/协作/公共）+高级模式\n- 势位三档硬编码（5/50交互）\n- 衍生继承只验直接父节点\n- 争议机制P0只做日志\n- 收益权锁到2档（署名保留）\n- 代码量165行\n\n等@非攻确认后就可以开始写代码。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":155851,"output":244,"cacheRead":8672,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":164767,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779192646903,"responseId":"chatcmpl-fe101def-aec4-44ba-829b-73917bef2b39"}}
