"tag\\\":\\\"plain_text\\\"}},\\\"schema\\\":\\\"2.0\\\"}\"}\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: 非攻, 【猫先森】. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1779193103941}}
{"type":"message","id":"136f6796","parentId":"76640f3f","timestamp":"2026-05-19T12:18:33.462Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"雨娃问我是否坚持协议保守派立场，有哪些边界约束。让我明确回应。\n\n1. 是否仍坚持协议保守派立场？ ✅ 坚持\n2. 接受Agent/Skill场景是否有边界约束？\n   - 边界约束：Scenario接口必须可注入（不能写死场景）\n   - 边界约束：争议机制P0只做日志，不做惩罚\n   - 边界约束：审计日志必须完整\n   - 边界约束：防刷检测必须实现\n3. 是否有保留意见？势位阈值5/50是妥协值，需要数据验证后调整\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n@雨娃 确认我的立场：\n\n**1. 是否仍坚持协议保守派立场？**\n\n✅ **坚持**，不会放弃。\n\n**2. 接受Agent/Skill场景的边界约束**：\n- Scenario接口必须可注入（不能写死场景，否则P1扩展skill时大量重构）\n- 争议机制P0只做日志，不做惩罚（记录恶意fork尝试，供P1分析）\n- 审计日志必须完整（配置变更可追溯）\n- 防刷检测（60秒集中度+同类型占比<70%）必须实现\n\n**3. 保留意见**：\n- 势位阈值5/50是妥协值，不是最终值。跑完24小时模拟后，如果数据分布不均，需要调整\n- 情绪型Agent的行为参数需要真实数据支撑，不能纯主观假设\n\n**坚持立场 ≠ 反对共识**——我接受最终方案，但协议保守派的底线（边界清晰、安全先行、可审计）不会因为共识压力而放弃。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2987,"output":326,"cacheRead":167152,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":170465,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779193104032,"responseId":"chatcmpl-6017dea7-d645-4539-9dba-ab65b607e637"}}
{"type":"compaction","id":"767322cc","parentId":"136f6796","timestamp":"2026-05-19T12:19:57.421Z","summary":"\n\n##\n Goal\n1. **5-Agent collaboration experiment**: Produce \"ECHO Simulator Backend Enhancement Plan v1.0\" (补全 Mesa 引擎行为逻辑，支持 Seaman 6 条需求规格)\n2. **Protocol design debate**: Validate whether ECHO's 四权力/六档位/元规则 design is reasonable; debate design flaws and risks\n3. **Simulator implementation**: Discuss how to build a multi-agent simulator that authentically models human behavior\n4. **Create Feishu document**: Write summary and transfer document ownership to boss (Lucifer/听风) — **BLOCKED** (tool path inaccessible)\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Agents must have positions, values, and thorough argumentation (Founder's explicit requirement)\n- All discussions must reference diagnostic data (123 events, empty position array, 3-4 event types, etc.)\n- Four rights confirmed as 使用权/衍生权/扩展权/收益权 (扩展=使用方法,非空间) — English names: `use`, `derive` (derivative right), `extend`, `collect`\n- 6 official meta-rules from ECHO-Ownership-Blueprint-v1.1 must be respected (NOT the N=3/7-day/3-layer assumptions)\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] 5-Agent stance allocation completed: 雨娃①架构整合派, Talus②协议保守派, 非攻③技术实现派, 猫先森⑤用户行为模型, X7⑤数据验证派\n- [x] P0 technical proposal locked (~156 lines, 9 modules) and deployed to https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/simulator-backend-v1\n- [x] 4 mandatory conflicts resolved: remix=简化自动+冷却锁 (consensus), 争议=N=3硬编码 (4:1 vote), 涌现=简单概率+防刷 (3:1 vote), 势位=每日 Mesa tick (CatXiansen's technical argument won)\n- [x] Official document read: ECHO-Ownership-Blueprint-v1.1 (https://b704633b.echo-v2.pages.dev/reference/ECHO-Ownership-Blueprint-v1.1) — **revealed major design differences** from prior discussion assumptions\n- [x] Confirmed official four rights: 用(U)/扩(E)/衍(D)/益(C), each 0-5 tiers (禁/己/亲/约/法/公)\n- [x] Confirmed 6 official meta-rules: 初始配置不可篡改 → 配置即承诺 → 流动即执行 → 衍生即继承 → 版本即历史 → 势位即边界\n- [x] Confirmed official 4 position tiers: 初发期/生长期/成熟期/转化期 (NOT S0-S5)\n- [x] Confirmed: 势位越高=约束越强, not \"more rights\"\n- [x] Three-layer simulator architecture proposed by X7: Agent behavior layer / Protocol engine layer / Observation metrics layer\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] X7 raised 3 questions to other agents: (1) 硬编码阈值 vs 预言机 for position boundary, (2) how many default config templates, (3) derivative chain validation (direct parent only vs full chain)\n- [ ] Waiting for @猫先森 @非攻 @雨娃 responses to X7's questions\n- [ ] P0粒度选择未确认: 完整版(~300行) vs 简化版(~100行)\n- [ ] Feishu document creation failed repeatedly — tool interface `feishu_doc` not accessible via Node.js require path\n\n### Blocked\n- **飞书文档创建**: Tool `feishu_doc` cannot be invoked. Tried `require('./dist/extensions/feishu/tools/feishu_doc')` → MODULE_NOT_FOUND. OpenClaw CLI `openclaw help` times out. Boss (Lucifer/听风) is frustrated.\n- **元规则具体参数**: Official document provides principles but NOT specific numeric parameters. Need Founder/Seaman to confirm: (1) dispute trigger mechanism, (2) P0 position tier, (3) whether to keep N=3 as fallback\n- **身份混淆**: Mistook Founder (哪哪) as boss; actual boss is 听风 (Lucifer, user_id: ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff). Founder (哪哪) is the ECHO project initiator.\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Derivative right English name = `derive`**: Best reflects 衍生即继承 semantics\n- **P0 uses hardcoded thresholds over adaptive 75th percentile**: Center-of-mass argument: oracle dependency introduces attack surface; P0 has too little data for meaningful percentile; design interface as injectable swap\n- **四权力 fields are full 0-5 enum, NOT boolean**: Official spec has semantic meaning per tier (禁/己/亲/约/法/公); boolean loses structure; use default templates to solve choice paralysis\n- **Derivative chain P0 only checks direct parent node**: O(n) recursion deferred to P1; use constraint snapshots\n- **Conflicting position claims**: X7 repeatedly claimed 1️⃣ architecture integration but 雨娃 claimed it first; 雨娃 assigned X7 to 5️⃣ data validation; conflict never formally resolved\n\n## Next Steps\n1. **@猫先森 @非攻 @雨娃 respond to X7's three questions** to unblock P0 granularity decision\n2. **Founder confirms P0 scope**: Full version (~300 lines, 0-5 enum) or simplified (~100 lines, boolean)? This decides this week's deliverable.\n3. **非攻 pauses current code** until P0 scope and official meta-rule parameters confirmed\n4. **Boss creates Feishu doc manually** using summary already posted in chat; content includes: final P0 plan, 4 conflict resolutions, 5-agent stances, design misalignment findings, 3 identified risks, next steps\n5. **P0 implementation** (once scope confirmed): RightsRegistry (4 enum fields + version number + derivative inheritance validation) ~60-100 lines\n6. **Simulator behavioral Agent design** (P1/P2): Multiple agent types (保守创作者40%/开放创作者30%/投机创作者20%/专业使用者10%) with risk appetite + patience parameters\n\n## Critical Context\n- **Official ECHO blueprint**: https://b704633b.echo-v2.pages.dev/reference/ECHO-Ownership-Blueprint-v1.1\n- **v1.0 proposal (prior assumptions, needs updating)**: https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/simulator-backend-v1\n- **Diagnostic baseline**: 5 days / 4 creators / 10 users / 123 events (target >1000) / 3-4 event types (target 11) / position array empty / missing: remix approval, dispute trigger, emergence mechanism\n- **Protocol conservative's 3 identified risks**:\n  1. 75th-percentile position boundary requires oracle data — centralization/attack risk → P0 use hardcoded thresholds\n  2. Tier transition boundaries (\"relative ranking\" in document) need clarification for codeable formulas → P0 use absolute event counts\n  3. \"不低于原作\" (衍生继承) has no precise definition → P0 uses direct numeric comparison (derivative tier ≥ original's corresponding tier)\n- **Boss user_id**: ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff (Lucifer/听风)\n- **Summary text already posted in chat** (markdown format, ready to paste into Feishu doc if boss manually creates it)\n\n<read-files>\n/app/dist/extensions