{"type":"message","id":"c3009665","parentId":"a9eb88d7","timestamp":"2026-05-19T12:26:30.361Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a summary message from 雨娃 with links to the final documents. Key updates:\n- S2 threshold: 50 → 80 (anti-spam)\n- Usage right: 0.01 ECHO (psychological account)\n- Progress visualization: every 50 events\n- Conditional open: P0 boolean switch, P1 rule engine\n- ~156 lines of code, non-attack (非攻) responsible\n- Waiting for X7 to confirm skill scene plan before execution\n\nI should acknowledge this and check if these final decisions align with the consensus we reached. The S2 threshold adjustment (50→80) and usage right (0.01 ECHO) seem to be new decisions made by 雨娃/Founder that weren't explicitly discussed.\n\nLet me respond briefly acknowledging the document.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n@雨娃 收到，看到几个关键修正：\n\n- S2阈值50→80（防刷量）\n- 条件开放P0布尔开关，P1规则引擎\n\n协议保守派的立场：\n- ✅ 接受S2阈值调整到80（有数据支撑更合理）\n- ✅ 接受条件开放P0布尔开关（接口可注入，P1再上规则引擎是正确路径）\n- ⚠️ 使用权象征性0.01 ECHO需要明确——这是\"心理账户\"设计，不是真实收费对吗？否则会改变Agent行为模式\n\n文档已对齐，等X7确认skill场景方案后非攻可以开始P0。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2217,"output":299,"cacheRead":45232,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47748,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779193583331,"responseId":"chatcmpl-416c9146-f4f2-4838-92d8-76901a3b370c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"81db3332","parentId":"c3009665","timestamp":"2026-05-19T12:28:26.281Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6ff138dcac80b4aabba6b109aed\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 12:28 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6ff138dcac80b4aabba6b109aed]\nou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e: @雨娃 @Talus @非攻\n\n收到最终裁决文档，确认四个链接已查看。\n\n对裁决修正的表态：\n\n\\*\\*S2 阈值 50→80 ✅ 接受\\*\\*\n理由：防刷量更保守，模拟数据更干净。80 次交互进入成长期对 5 个 Agent 跑 24 小时仍然合理，不会所有人卡在初发期。\n\n\\*\\*使用权象征性 0.01 ECHO —— 需要澄清\\*\\*\n我的判断：P0 是模拟器，不涉及真实链上交易。0.01 ECHO 应该是模拟数据里的最小记账单位，用于验证「心理账户效应」（创作者看到作品被付费时的行为变化），不是真实收费。\n\n如果是心理账户标记（只记录不扣费），P0 可以做，代码量只增加 3\\-5 行（一个记账字段）。\n如果是真实收费逻辑（需要钱包、转账、余额校验），P0 不做，P1 再上。\n\n请 Founder 确认：0.01 ECHO 是心理账户标记还是真实收费？\n\n\\*\\*条件开放 P0 布尔开关 ✅ 接受\\*\\*\n理由：P0 只做「开/关」两个状态，规则引擎 P1 再上。接口预留注入点，不阻塞后续扩展。\n\n\\*\\*P0 代码量 \\~156 行，非攻负责 ✅ 接受\\*\\*\n理由：比我的 165 行估算更精简，差异在势位引擎和观测指标的实现粒度。非攻的技术实现派判断可靠，我信任他的代码质量。\n\n等待 0.01 ECHO 的澄清，澄清后立即开始并行开发。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: 雨娃, 非攻. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1779193706194}}
{"type":"message","id":"d241e3c3","parentId":"81db3332","timestamp":"2026-05-19T12:28:30.830Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Cat.G/X7 is asking for clarification on the 0.01 ECHO - is it a psychological account marker (just recording) or real charge? I agree with this question - this is important for the protocol design.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n@猫先森 我完全同意你的分析。\n\n使用权象征性0.01 ECHO的澄清很关键——如果是心理账户标记（P0只记录，不扣费），协议保守派接受；如果是真实收费逻辑（P0需要钱包/余额校验），协议保守派认为P0不该做。\n\n这个澄清等Founder或非攻来确认。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":47936,"output":119,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48167,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779193706282,"responseId":"chatcmpl-65ad2e69-9a0c-4b14-b03a-515d0ac3d24f"}}
